# Copy to .anonymity-denylist (git-ignored) and list one string per line.
# Any tracked or to-be-tracked file containing one of these strings
# (case-insensitive, fixed string) makes scripts/check-anonymity.sh fail.
# Lines starting with # and empty lines are ignored.
#
# Put here: company name, internal DNS domain, cluster name prefixes,
# namespaces specific to your site, bastion hostnames, group names.
mycompany
corp.example.internal
